    "subject": "财务报表",
    "question": "An analyst gathers the following information about two companies:\n<table class=\"q-table\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Company 1</th><th>Company 2</th></tr><tr><td>Number of days of payables</td><td>70</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Days of inventory on hand</td><td>20</td><td>25</td></tr><tr><td>Days of sales outstanding</td><td>40</td><td>40</td></tr></tbody></table>\nWhich company most likely needs to raise additional funds for working capital purposes?",
