    "question": "An adviser gathers the following information about a client's retirement income needs:\nThe current balance of the client's retirement fund is $150,000.\nThe client plans to retire in 15 years' time.\n$500,000 in today's money is needed to fund retirement.\nNo further retirement fund contributions will be made.\nInflation is expected to average 2% per year over the next 15 years. Based only on the above information and ignoring taxes, the minimum annual rate of return required to meet the client's retirement income objective is closest to:",
