    "question": "Which of the following is among the recommended procedures for compliance with the Standard relating to misrepresentation?\nProcedure 1: Each member should prepare for client distribution a list of services that the member is capable of performing.\nProcedure 2: Members should cite specific quotations as attributable to 'investment experts' when confidentiality of the sources has to be preserved.",
